# Next.js 开发规范

## 新特性

### 1. Partial Prerendering (PPR)

```typescript
import { Suspense } from 'react';

export default function Page() {
  return (
    <div>
      <Header />
      <Suspense fallback={<Skeleton />}>
        <UserFeed />
      </Suspense>
    </div>
  );
}
```bash

### 2. Server Actions

```typescript
// app/actions.ts
'use server';

async function createUser(formData: FormData) {
  'use server';
  const name = formData.get('name');
  await db.user.create({ name });
  revalidatePath('/users');
  return { success: true };
}

// app/page.tsx
import { createUser } from './actions';

<form action={createUser}>
  <input name="name" />
  <button type="submit">提交</button>
</form>
```bash

### 3. use() 在 Server Components

```typescript
async function UserProfile({ userPromise }) {
  const user = await userPromise;
  return <div>{user.name}</div>;
}

<Suspense fallback={<Loading />}>
  <UserProfile userPromise={getUser(id)} />
</Suspense>
```bash

## 数据获取

### Server Component

```typescript
async function getData() {
  const res = await fetch('https://api.example.com/data', {
    next: { revalidate: 3600, tags: ['data'] }
  });
  return res.json();
}

export default async function Page() {
  const data = await getData();
  return <div>{data.title}</div>;
}
```bash

### Client Component

```typescript
'use client';
import { use } from 'react';

function UserList({ usersPromise }) {
  const users = use(usersPromise);
  return <ul>{users.map(u => <li key={u.id}>{u.name}</li>)}</ul>;
}
```bash

## 路由规范

### 目录结构

```bash
app/
├── (group)/           # 路由组
│   ├── page.tsx
├── [id]/
│   ├── page.tsx
├── api/
│   └── users/
│       └── route.ts
└── layout.tsx
```bash

### 特殊文件

- `page.tsx` - 页面
- `layout.tsx` - 布局
- `loading.tsx` - 加载态
- `error.tsx` - 错误边界
- `not-found.tsx` - 404
- `route.ts` - API 端点

## 最佳实践

1. 默认 Server Component
2. 表单用 Server Actions
3. 用 Suspense 实现流式加载
4. 静态内容用 ISR

